39. Tungabhadra Industries Ltd. v. Commercial Tax Officer [I960
] 11 S.T.C. 827 at 835 (S.C.), the Supreme Court held :
...hydrogenated oil still continues to be 'groundnut oil' notwithstanding the processing which is merely for the purpose of rendering the oil more stable thus improving its keeping qualities for those who desire to consume groundnut oil.
